'''Lorraine''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the [[Lakeshore]] [[Cooking Table]]. She sells [[Chef]] [[Jobs|Job]] related [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Slice-N-Dice Chef Pants]]
*[[Slice-N-Dice Chef Hat]]
*[[Slice-N-Dice Chef Shoes]]
*[[Slice-N-Dice Chef Shirt]]
*[[Chef's Power Shard of Timing III]]
*[[Chef's Necklace of Timing III]]
*[[Chef's Skillet of Talent III]]
*[[Stainberry Chocolate Gumdrop Recipe]]
*[[Sizzling Snowberry Saute Recipe]]

==Trivia==
*Lorraine was introduced in-game on the update of October 1, 2013.
